  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="rwanda.html">Rwanda</a> / Gorillas of the Volcanoes</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">The quickest, most luxurious route to a life-list encounter — fly into Kigali and drive a smooth two hours to the Volcanoes National Park, where you'll spend a magical hour with a mountain gorilla family in the misty Virunga foothills.</p>
        <p>Rwanda makes gorilla trekking wonderfully easy and refined: short transfers, exceptional lodges and a seamless permit process. Trekking is suitable for reasonably fit travellers aged 15 and over.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 4-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive in Kigali</h3><p>Met at the airport for a short tour of Rwanda's clean, creative capital — the moving Genocide Memorial and a buzzing craft market — before driving north to your lodge near the Volcanoes National Park.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes-area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Gorilla trekking</h3><p>An early briefing at park headquarters, then into the bamboo and forest with trackers ahead. The moment you reach the family — a great silverback at rest, mothers and tumbling youngsters — is unforgettable. The afternoon is yours to rest and reflect.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes-area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Golden monkeys &amp; the foothills</h3><p>Track the playful, endangered golden monkeys through the bamboo, then choose a hike to the Dian Fossey tomb, the twin lakes, or a warm cultural visit to a local community.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes-area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Return to Kigali &amp; depart</h3><p>A scenic drive back through the terraced hills to Kigali for your onward flight.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

