        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Gorillas%20of%20the%20Volcanoes"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Sabyinyo Silverback</h3><p>A warm community-owned lodge below the volcanoes.</p></div></a>
      </div>
