          <li>Golden monkey trek &amp; a guided activity</li>
          <li>Expert driver-guide &amp; ranger fees</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Kigali city tour &amp; drinking water</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; all gratuities</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$5,400 per person sharing</strong>; single supplement available. International flights, visas and a second gorilla permit are extra. Rwanda's gorilla permit is premium-priced and strictly limited — we book yours early. Best in the drier months (June–September &amp; December–February); minimum age 15.</p>
